window.SEARCH_INDEX=[{"url": ".", "title": "Starwell Holdings", "text": "Dream with Starwell. Starwell Holdings is a private investment and operating company headquartered in Tel Aviv, building platforms across IT Services and Real Estate, with passive capital allocation to alternative assets. ↓ What We Do IT Services Acquiring and operating IT Services businesses. Learn More → Real Estate Development and GP investments in Israel, select co-investments. Learn More → Capital Long-term investment portfolio across public markets and direct private positions. Learn More → About Starwell Learn more about Starwell A privately held global investment firm building and owning platforms across IT Services and Real Estate, with passive capital allocation to alternative assets - a long-term, operator-led approach. Learn more about Starwell →"}, {"url": "our-story", "title": "About Us", "text": "About Us Starwell Holdings Starwell Holdings is a global private investment and operating company. We invest and build across real estate, operating businesses, alternative investments, and public markets. Beyond capital allocation, Starwell acts as a long-term owner and active partner - founding companies, scaling platforms, and working alongside management teams to develop durable businesses and real assets. Our approach combines entrepreneurial execution with disciplined investment principles. We focus on opportunities where long-term thinking, operational involvement, and strategic alignment can create enduring value across cycles and generations. Starwell Holdings was founded by Amit Kochavi, who serves as Chairman and CEO. Meet the team → Business Focus Starwell focuses on building and investing in businesses and assets where long-term ownership, active involvement, and disciplined execution drive sustainable value. Our activities span four core areas: Real Estate We invest in, develop, and operate residential, commercial, and mixed-use assets, partnering with experienced operators and taking an owner-led approach to development, asset management, and value creation. Operating Businesses Starwell builds and scales operating companies alongside strong management teams, with a focus on businesses that benefit from strategic guidance, operational improvement, and long-term capital support. Technology & Innovation We back and help build technology-enabled platforms, with particular emphasis on applied technology, AI-driven solutions, and businesses that enhance traditional industries through innovation. Public Markets & Alternatives We allocate capital across public equities and alternative investments with a long-term, fundamentals-driven mindset, complementing our private market and operating activities. Across all areas, Starwell prioritizes conviction-led investments, alignment with partners, and a hands-on approach that reflects our belief in building enduring value over time. Strategy Our approach combines long-term, disciplined capital with an operator’s mindset. We prioritize value creation through active engagement and strategic guidance. Partnership We focus on selective, high-conviction investments where we can be thoughtful partners and long-term stewards of capital. More about Starwell Learn about our history and our team The roots we build on"}, {"url": "our-history", "title": "Our History", "text": "Our History Legacy Starwell builds on four generations of entrepreneurship, capital stewardship, and public leadership. The roots of this legacy trace back to Max Factor, the pioneering entrepreneur who transformed the global cosmetics industry and built one of the most enduring consumer brands of the 20th century through innovation, craftsmanship, and an uncompromising standard of excellence. Max Factor David M. Heyman They also extend to David M. Heyman, a distinguished philanthropist and business leader whose work helped shape modern philanthropic institutions, with a lasting focus on education, community development, and long-term societal progress. In Israel, the legacy continued through the Buchman family, whose multi-generational involvement in business, real estate, and philanthropy contributed meaningfully to the country’s economic development and social fabric. Across decades, the family combined disciplined capital allocation with a deep sense of responsibility to the communities in which they operated. Starwell is the modern expression of these roots - a capital platform and operational engine designed to create companies, develop real assets, and partner with exceptional operators. The underlying values remain constant: integrity, long-term ownership, and a responsibility to build things that endure."}, {"url": "our-team", "title": "Our Team", "text": "Our Team Leadership Amit Kochavi Chairman, CEO & Founder Amit founded Starwell Holdings to build a global private investment and operating company that combines long-term capital with operational execution. His career spans technology, real estate, and civic leadership. He is the founder of Doss Israel Ltd. and shareholder in Doss Inc., Senior Advisor to the Mayor of Sderot, and a member of President Herzog’s “Voice of the People” initiative. Amit continues to grow Starwell’s portfolio of platforms and partnerships, focused on building enduring value across cycles and geographies. SG Shirly Gur Arie Executive Assistant Shirly supports Starwell’s leadership and day-to-day operations, coordinating across the firm’s platforms and partners to keep the organization running smoothly."}, {"url": "technology", "title": "IT Services", "text": "IT Services Acquiring controlling or significant stakes in IT services companies, in Israel and beyond. The Thesis The IT services market is large, growing, and highly fragmented. Most of it consists of independent companies built on expertise and long-standing client relationships, without the backing of a larger group. In a technology landscape that never stops changing - cloud migration, artificial intelligence, and successive waves of transformation - businesses need a trusted external technology partner more than ever. Starwell acquires controlling or significant stakes in established, profitable IT services companies. We partner with owners and operators to preserve what works, while building around them the infrastructure and discipline of a platform built to last. 01 Acquire Controlling or significant stakes in established, profitable IT services companies. 02 Integrate Central systems, shared infrastructure, and a consistent standard of service across the portfolio. 03 Grow Operational improvement, talent development, and expanded service capabilities, driving long-term value creation. Portfolio Cormi IT Role: Founder and Majority Shareholder Implementation and integration company specializing in ERP, CRM, and workflow systems for traditional businesses. Website → Doss Inc Role: Strategic Partner Adaptive ERP and data platform with composable architecture. Unifies fragmented workflows across orders, inventory, procurement, production, and finance. Website →"}, {"url": "real-estate", "title": "Starwell Real Estate", "text": "Starwell Real Estate Development and strategic real estate investment across Israel and the United States. Markets Israel Development & Advisory Residential and mixed-use development in Tel Aviv and central Israel, alongside institutional developers and public-sector partners. Focus on urban renewal and projects with structural demand tailwinds. United States Capital Allocation Limited partner investments in value-add multifamily and industrial logistics strategies, alongside institutional operators with demonstrated track records. Selected Experience Beyond Beyond Towers ● Tel Aviv, Israel ■ Advisory & Owner Representative (Doron Kochavi) △ Tidhar Group, Union Group, Himnuta–KKL Large-scale mixed-use development comprising office, residential, and commercial space. Total project value estimated at NIS 4–4.5 billion. Urban Renewal Rova 7 Rova 7 — Mevoot Yafo ● Tel Aviv, Israel ■ Strategic Advisory — municipality relations, commercial concept, and marketing strategy △ Keren Reality, Kardan Real Estate (50/50 JV) 55-dunam urban renewal project encompassing approximately 890 residential units, 5,000 sqm of commercial space, 20,000 sqm of office space, and 12 dunams of public area. Approved master plan (May 2023). Dawson The Dawson ● Cartersville, Georgia, US ■ Limited Partner △ Wilpon & Co. 192-unit multifamily value-add acquisition. Terminal Terminal Logistics Fund II ● US Logistics Markets ■ Limited Partner △ Center Capital Partners Private real estate fund focused on industrial logistics assets across US markets. Website → Portfolio Kochavi Kochavi Real Estate Portfolio ● Tel Aviv, Israel ■ Portfolio-level management, advisory, and future development planning △ Developer: Doron Kochavi Multi-decade development and investment portfolio built by Doron Kochavi, encompassing over 750 units across more than 20 buildings in Tel Aviv."}, {"url": "capital", "title": "Starwell Capital", "text": "Starwell Capital The capital allocation arm of Starwell Holdings - deploying capital across private equity, public markets, hedge funds, and real estate. Approach Patient, conviction-driven capital allocation across private equity, public markets, and alternative strategies. Starwell Capital oversees the firm’s external capital deployment. The mandate spans private equity with a focus on AI-enabled roll-ups, long-term public market holdings, allocations to long-strategy hedge funds, and real estate. We invest with a long time horizon and concentrate where we have genuine conviction. 01 Private Equity Private equity investments in buy-out and roll-up strategies, acquiring and improving traditional businesses through operational, financial, and technological efficiency. 02 Public Markets Long-term concentrated holdings in public companies where the firm has deep conviction in the business and management team. 03 Hedge Funds Selective allocations to long-strategy hedge funds with differentiated process and consistent risk-adjusted performance. 04 Real Estate Capital allocations to real estate funds and structures as part of a diversified long-term portfolio. Portfolio Pioneers — Healthcare Staffing AI Roll-Up Role: Investor AI-native roll-up of healthcare staffing agencies, modernizing legacy operators with proprietary AI to automate workflows and dramatically improve recruiter output. Website → Kodiak Holdings Role: Investor A long-term partner for aspiring small business owners, backing the next generation of American owner-operators with equity financing and support across due diligence, transaction structuring, capital raising, and ongoing operations. Website → Legion Holdings Role: Investor AI-native growth buyout firm investing in business services companies, modernizing their operations with AI, and compounding value through disciplined M&A. Website → Noked Capital Hedge fund allocation. Hazavim Hedge fund allocation."}, {"url": "news", "title": "News", "text": "News News & Insights Company news, market commentary, and updates on our investments. All Real Estate Company News Real Estate Dec 21, 2025 Lipa Meir to Rent Offices in Beyond Tower for 11 Million NIS Per Year Lipa Meir & Co. is leaving Amot Investments House in Tel Aviv to lease 7,000 sqm of office space across 4 floors in the Beyond Tower project from Tidhar, Union, and Himnuta. Read More → Company News Jun 3, 2025 Circles Merges Operations with U.S.-Based Doss Circles is merging its operations with U.S.-based Doss and will become the Israeli sales and marketing center for the company. Read More → Company News May 29, 2025 חברת Circles מתמזגת עם Doss האמריקאית חברת Circles מתמזגת עם Doss האמריקאית ותהפוך למרכז הפיתוח הישראלי שלה. עמית כוכבי ימונה למנהל הפיתוח הגלובלי. Read More → Real Estate May 6, 2025 Lee & Associates – Atlanta Facilitates Sale of 28-Acre Industrial Site to Terminal Logistics Center Capital's IOS platform, Terminal Logistics, has acquired a 28-acre site in Gainesville, GA. Read More → Real Estate Sep 4, 2024 גבעתיים על הגובה: המגדל שהפך לגבוה בישראל פרויקט ביונד בגבעתיים חצה את גובה 240 המטרים והפך למגדל הגבוה בישראל. בסיום הבנייה יגיע לגובה 320 מטרים. Read More → Real Estate Sep 4, 2024 New Tower Claims Title of Tallest in Israel New tower in Givataim claims title of tallest in Israel, rising to 320 meters with office and residential space. Read More → Real Estate Nov 15, 2022 Meitar Leases 17 Floors in Givatayim Tower Meitar Law Offices leases 17 floors in Givatayim tower for NIS 54 million annually. Read More →"}, {"url": "contact", "title": "Contact", "text": "Contact Get in Touch For inquiries about investment opportunities, partnerships, or potential transactions, please complete the form below. A member of our team will respond promptly. Leave empty: First Name * Last Name * Organization Email * Subject Message What is 10 + 10? Submit Offices Tel Aviv Beyond Towers Giv’atayim, Israel Los Angeles 11601 Wilshire Blvd Los Angeles, CA 90025 USA"}, {"url": "careers", "title": "Careers", "text": "Join Us Careers at Starwell We’re a small, high-conviction team building platforms across IT Services and Real Estate, with passive capital allocation to alternative assets. We look for people who think long-term and operate with precision. How We Work Long-Term Thinking We build for decades, not quarters. Every decision is made with durability and permanence in mind. Operational Excellence We get into the details. Great outcomes come from rigorous execution and deep domain knowledge. Integrity We say what we mean and do what we say - with partners, portfolio companies, and each other. Entrepreneurial Spirit We are builders. We back people who create things that didn’t exist before. Open Positions Click any role to learn more and apply. All Technology Real Estate Capital & Investments Operations Finance No open positions in this category at the moment. Check back soon or reach out directly at careers@starwellholdings.com . Don’t see the right role? We’re always interested in meeting exceptional people. Send us a note and tell us how you’d contribute. Get in Touch"}, {"url": "sitemap", "title": "Sitemap", "text": "Sitemap Sitemap Every page on the Starwell Holdings website, organized in one place. Company Home About Us Our History Our Team News Careers What We Do IT Services Real Estate Capital Resources Contact Search Sitemap עברית"}];
